{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2020-03-12 10:30:00', 'title': 'UPS BOARD APPOINTS CAROL TOMÉ AS CEO DAVID ABNEY TO BE EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN', 'text': 'UPS BOARD APPOINTS CAROL TOMÉ AS CEO; DAVID ABNEY TO BE EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN.UPS - NAMED CAROL TOMÉ AS UPS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JUNE 1.UPS - DAVID ABNEY, CURRENT CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL REMAIN IN HIS ROLE UNTIL JUNE 1 WHEN HE WILL BECOME EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN OF BOARD.UPS - ON SEPTEMBER 30, WILLIAM JOHNSON, UPS LEAD INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR, WILL ASSUME ROLE OF NON-EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN.UPS - ON SEPT 30, WILLIAM JOHNSON, UPS LEAD INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR, WILL ASSUME ROLE OF NON-EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN.UPS -  DAVID ABNEY WILL REMAIN AS A SPECIAL CONSULTANT THROUGH END OF 2020 AND THEN RETIRE AFTER 46 YEARS OF UPS SERVICE.UPS - TOMÉ IS FORMER EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CFO OF HOME DEPOT.'}